(7682026, 1257189, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a fine image!  Walks the line between real life and diorama, magical in any case.  It seems self-contained, yet those far-flung mountains, beautiful and mysterious, beckon.  The overall green wash pulls it together, giving it that insular feel of a brigadoon.  The blushing fog and yellow points of light are a chiming counterpoint.  Thoroughly enchanting.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'What a fine image!  Walks the line between real life and diorama, magical in any case.  It seems self-contained, yet those far-flung mountains, beautiful and mysterious, beckon.  The overall green wash pulls it together, giving it that insular feel of a brigadoon.  The blushing fog and yellow points of light are a chiming counterpoint.  Thoroughly enchanting.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2020-12-21 22:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
